WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 14  -  Destined Rivals

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:42.310
Is everything ready?

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:47.500
And action!

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.410
Look at that leg!

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.380
All that preparation just for this one scene!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.620
And that's a wrap!

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.560
And now, we need the light over there.

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.230
Make sure it doesn't cast too much shadow!

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.990
Quite the setup you've got here.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.410
Well, well, if it isn't our stage director, Mr. Tanabe!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.990
I wanted to come and see how things were coming along.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.330
Good, thank you!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:25.970
Who's that girl?

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:30.350
She didn't make the cut in the auditions, but we had a small part for her.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.780
You cut her?

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.920
I don't believe you guys!

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:40.810
And action!

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:45.580
I can't... play.. tennis!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.630
Zoom in! Zoom in!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.360
Not on Emi! On that girl!

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.090
Got it!

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:32.200
Here, you dropped this.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.290
Cut!

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.200
Are you all right up there?

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.770
Yes!

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:39.900
I was so nervous!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:00.720
Hey Dad, can you take me to London with you?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:05.180
I'd like to watch some plays there and get an international perspective of the theater!

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:09.810
You're turning into quite a rival for your mother.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:14.440
And one day, I'll play in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.780
That's a very difficult role, Ayumi.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:23.460
Ms. Tsukikage once told me that to play the Scarlet Angel,

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.760
you have to completely disassociate yourself with your humanity.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:33.780
You know that I find you extremely talented, but talent is not enough.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.400
You also need life experience.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:42.830
You've been an actress for twenty years and you're an established superstar.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:46.000
And yet, Ms. Tsukikage still won't let you play the Scarlet Angel.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:46.980
Ayumi!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.970
I intend to play any and all roles,

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:57.690
and take those experiences to play the Scarlet Angel.

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:07.900
Why don't you two forget your rivalry for the time being and let's have some dinner instead, all right?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:12.330
Pure Adolescence

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:29.610
No one's even mentioned my illness... I wonder why...

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:32.060
She's pretty awful.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.390
Well, it's made for her fans.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.160
Look, it's Maya!

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.010
Is that your only scene?

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:40.140
Oh, there's another scene after that...

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.380
Wow, it's a close-up.

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.140
And she doesn't even have a major part!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.430
This...

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:57.860
I saw you in that movie <i>Pure Adolescence</i>! I was so surprised!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:01.940
Why don't you come and join us for lunch and tell us all about Emi!

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.540
Um... sure.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.740
Well, isn't she popular?

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.410
She's in one diabolical teen movie and everyone fawns over her.

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:13.050
It was only a bit part too.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.410
Only you, Miss Kitajima!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:19.970
Only you could sew both sleeves together like that!

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.380
Silly girl.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.190
Maya really is all at sea when she's not acting, isn't she?

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.410
The Ondine Troupe

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.170
What are we going to do?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.840
What's going on?

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:41.080
They're planning to put on a performance at the orphanage.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.800
And what are they performing?

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:44.920
<i>Beauty and the Beast</i>.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:48.510
But they can't find anyone who wants to play the Beast's underling.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.640
That's why they're getting all worked up.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:52.830
Ayumi?

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:58.800
Will you let me play the Beast's underling?

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:01.680
But it's a tiny jester role.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:03.600
You really don't have to take the role, Ayumi!

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:06.690
But that's exactly why I want to do it.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.130
I don't care what kind of role it is.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.700
Yes, I'm going to play any role I can get my hands on.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.840
So that I can one day play the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:20.340
"But won't you forgive us?"

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.000
What's going on?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.170
The Acting Club is rehearsing a new piece.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.900
The Acting Club is putting on a new play?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.290
Acting Club

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.300
You want to be in our play?

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.690
Yes. Any role will be fine.

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:36.310
I'll do anything!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:40.760
You can't just waltz in here and demand to be put on stage!

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.180
That's right!

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:44.730
There aren't even enough roles for our own club members!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:45.730
It just wouldn't be fair.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.030
Wait.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:47.820
President?

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.440
Kitajima.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.550
Do you mean what you say when you say you'll take on any role?

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.040
Yes!

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:56.800
We've worked hard for these roles.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.330
Are you sure you can keep up?

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.550
If you can, then I'll give you a role.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.160
You're not seriously going to give her a role, are you?

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.330
Are you kidding me?

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.250
No, this is the perfect opportunity to show that nobody cares about her...

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.790
being in some low-budget movie.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.110
Kitajima!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:26.280
You're up!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.730
Yes!

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:31.120
You're playing a passerby.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.510
I want you to walk from one end of the stage to the other.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:35.480
A passerby?

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.510
You don't want to do it?

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:40.210
No, that's not what I meant!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:43.420
So... what kind of person is this passerby?

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:45.730
What kind of person?!

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:47.480
Just an ordinary passerby!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:53.930
But, are they old or young? Rich or poor?

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.520
What profession are they in?

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:59.970
I mean, I believe all of those details would influence how they walk, so...

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.980
I'm sorry... I'm babbling...

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:09.010
Fine. She's a peddler woman.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.950
What mental state is she in?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:14.540
Hm... She's exhausted and walking home.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:15.990
Got it!

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:39.570
It would never have occurred to me to think up a background for a passerby.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:42.250
She's certainly not your average girl.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:47.540
Memorial Cultural Festival

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:54.730
Prez, we've got a problem!

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:56.260
Our lead actress, Nakamura,

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.830
was rushed to the hospital this morning with appendicitis.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.140
What?!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.140
Does anyone here know the lines for the female lead?

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.420
What are we going to do?

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.090
We can't raise the curtain!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.510
Well, if no one minds, I could try and play the female lead...

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.960
Are you serious?

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.770
You can't take the lead; you don't fit the part at all!

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.790
Well, do you have anyone else who can do it?

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.430
Five minutes till show time!

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:33.630
Fine. If you think you can do it, then do it.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:36.010
But you'd <i>better</i> not mess this up.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.690
Is Kitajima still not ready yet?

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:20.680
I'm putting on my mask...

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:26.000
the Queen's mask.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:30.280
Announcing Her Royal Highness, Queen Onalie!

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:42.140
Oh no...

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.780
You! Insolent girl!

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:49.220
Remove your foot!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.620
My deepest apologies!

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:55.530
You have my well wishes, Your Highness.

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:57.540
And ours, Your Highness.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.550
You all look well, too.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.190
Maya is like a totally different person!

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:09.850
She's acting like a queen - like a real, bona fide queen!

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:12.250
Your Highness, anyone would look well in your presence!

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:15.770
It went really well today! Good job!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.880
I can't believe how <i>different</i> she was.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:24.450
This force... that exuded from her whole body.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:25.270
That intense voice...

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:27.700
I was overwhelmed.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.280
Is that really the girl who played the Queen?

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.720
I can't believe it either.

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:40.030
Oh no, my uniform's all dirty now... what should I do?

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.460
My face too!

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:44.300
Why am I such a klutz?!

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:53.790
No... I refuse to release the acting rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:57.630
Ms. Tsukikage, how long do you intend to keep this up?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.520
You can't even hold proper rehearsals in this place.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:04.010
How can you possibly mentor an actress who can play the role of the Scarlet Angel?

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:11.720
If you allow us to take care of it, we'll hold the performance in the country's top venue.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:16.720
Ms. Tsukikage... My father also desired this for a very long time.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.590
Ah yes... your father.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:22.930
He hasn't given up on <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> yet then.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:27.770
If you hand the rights over to me so that we can put on the show, I could give you...

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:32.520
enough money to get out of this miserable place.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.450
I refuse.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.350
I will not relinquish my rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:40.940
You can offer me millions and I will still decline...

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:45.540
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i> belongs to me and Ichiren Ozaki...

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:48.830
Ms. Tsukikage?! Are you all right?

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:49.990
Ma'am!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.300
Ma'am!

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.030
This is all your fault!

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.800
You made her have this attack!

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.010
Call a doctor.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:59.760
You can yell at me later, but right now, she needs a doctor!

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:13.330
Did you do this?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.010
Maybe it was unnecessary.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:19.060
She's stable for now.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.730
But she needs to undergo some thorough tests.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:23.780
What's going on?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:25.200
Rei!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.750
Take care, little one.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.840
Maya, what happened?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.250
Stop calling me that!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.490
I have a name and it's Maya Kitajima!

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:49.640
I was just wondering why you didn't take up the offer to join the Ondine Troupe, little one.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.460
You'd get everything you need, including all your fees paid.

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:58.050
You could live in a dorm and you'd have the opportunity to participate in rehearsals.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.940
But I...

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:05.040
But I like Ms. Tsukikage!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.040
And everybody in this group!

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.040
Then, you should help her by leaving.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.390
At least she'd have one less mouth to feed.

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.100
It would help her a lot.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:16.390
Well, if you ever change your mind, just drop by the theater.

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.890
Don't you think you were a little too harsh on her, sir?

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:33.900
Yeah, I guess she was hurt.

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:37.800
You know, sir, you always act differently from your normal self...

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:40.730
when you're around that girl.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:45.630
Why do I always find myself talking to her like that?

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:50.510
But this is the way it has to be.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.730
I'll keep playing the villain for her.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.810
At least she'll have one less mouth to feed.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.350
It would help her a lot.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.540
I'm just a burden to her.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:19.580
Kawaue Books

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:26.280
I wonder if there are any auditions at the moment...

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:36.040
Ayumi Himekawa is playing a light entertainment role in the charity play at the orphanage...

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:41.310
The featured play is <i>The Prince and the Pauper</i>.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.350
Ayumi's playing the...

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.980
Ayumi...

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.860
So, what do you think?

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.900
Do I look like a boy now?

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:04.810
When I act, no matter what role I'm in, I intend to do my very best!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:08.290
Now, I'm going to focus on the role of Tom.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.720
Shall we start the rehearsal?

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:14.690
"Please, Master! A single coin... A blessing even!"

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:16.520
"Get away from me!"

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.720
Please... let me try that one more time!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.500
"Please, Master, I'm begging you! Just one coin!"

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.340
"A single coin!"

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:29.330
"You could save me with a single coin!"

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:37.370
Himekawa

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:43.660
Ayumi... aren't you taking this a little too far?

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.750
You've already got a pretty good handle on the role of Tom.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:52.730
Pretty good, you say? I want my Tom to be perfect!

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.690
Hey... aren't those the guys from our old troupe?

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:05.470
We haven't seen you guys in a while.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.800
We thought you'd left to go to another acting troupe...

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:18.770
Please forgive us!

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:23.760
At the competition, Onodera told us that if we helped him, he would let us join Ondine.

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:37.560
So you're saying... that you set up that whole thing?

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.510
I don't believe it!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.710
Do you have any idea how that made us feel?!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:44.290
You betrayed your own friends just to get into Ondine?

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:48.220
And then, Onodera denied that he ever made that promise.

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:50.950
We were such fools.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:56.920
Ondine is supported by the Daito Theater.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:02.420
This was their ploy to ruin our troupe, ruin Ms. Tsukikage...

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.710
and get her to sign over the rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>!

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:10.700
I'll never forget this, Masumi Hayami. Never!

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.900
How's Ms. Tsukikage feeling today?

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:21.430
I brought these as a get well gift.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.660
You're not fooling anyone!

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:33.670
Even though you were the one plotting to tear our troupe apart...

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.510
At the competition, when you found me outside, waiting in the rain...

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:39.680
for them to return...

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:42.330
You must have found it hilarious!

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:46.400
Maya!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.790
Is something wrong?

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:01.740
No. Would you like a lift home?

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:05.770
How's Ms. Tsukikage doing?

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:09.510
Well...

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:18.340
Ma'am!

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:20.940
Rei, what happened?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.500
Has something happened to her?

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:25.090
She can be admitted to a hospital now.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:25.770
What?

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:28.050
They told me that someone is paying all her hospital bills and medical fees.

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:31.270
That's why the ambulance turned up.

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.030
But who?

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.910
The person in question also brought a get well gift.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:35.960
Can you guess what it is?

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.370
It's the person who gave me the purple roses!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:45.630
Yep, it's your die-hard fan!

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:47.570
Look, there's a letter with it.

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:55.290
I finally found where you'd got to and found out your tutor was ill.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:21:00.970
I know it's presumptuous of me, but please accept my help.

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:05.420
Please get back on stage as soon as you can.

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:08.400
I'm waiting for you, Miss Maya Kitajima.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.160
Your Fan.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.620
Maya, you've got to pull yourself together!

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:16.210
Rei, I've got to try my hardest!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.350
For my one and only fan!

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:22.590
Please wait for me, Mr. or Mrs. Purple Rose...

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:26.300
I'm going to become a world-class actress!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.340
Someone good enough to star in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:35.010
That was the moment that Maya decided to pursue the phantom masterpiece <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:41.990
Ayumi Himekawa was also looking ahead, setting <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> in her sights.

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:46.550
Two rare and special fourteen-year-old girls... will they ever...

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:49.510
attain the role of the Scarlet Angel?

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
From morning until night, from dusk till dawn,

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:15.370
Asa kara yoru made yoru kara asa made

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
you can feel the warmth of our love.

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:23.310
Futari ai no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
All year round, every minute and every second,

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:30.000
Shunkashuutou mo ippun ichibyou mo

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
you can feel the warmth of our skin.

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:37.940
Futari hada no ondo wo itsumo kanjiru desho

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
This excitement is burning brightly like the sun,

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:46.190
Kono dokidoki wa makka ni moeru taiyou

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
let us burn brightly, let us burn until we're hot

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:51.480
Atsuku moete atsuku togashite

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
and make love!

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.290
Koi wo shimashou!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:58.990
It's so Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.760
Make it Make it Naked!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Let's hold and be true to each other!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.070
Sunao na mama dakiaou!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
And let's add more heat! I love the heat!

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:10.570
Isso mekimeki nekki! mekimeki daisuki!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Feel the love!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.960
Aishiae!

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:27.680
Ms. Tsukikage has been hospitalized and we have no rehearsals for the time being,

00:23:27.680 --> 00:23:29.630
but I want to act.

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:31.790
I just can't contain this compulsion.

00:23:31.790 --> 00:23:34.400
I don't care what role I play, I just want to act.

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:38.580
I don't care what anyone says about me.

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:43.610
If only to answer the person who watches over me... the person who sends me the purple roses.

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:46.090
I want to improve!

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 15 - A Trap

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:50.420
Ayumi... you'll go that far for a role?!
